<p>What to say: this is my favourite find in the project, so relax the delivery a little. It shows how far &quot;reproduce the reference&quot; goes when taken seriously. The conclusion matters more than the anecdote: because the origin of those seven digits is understood, the tolerance can be set at 2e-7, and anything above it is a genuine error.</p>
